              "text": "jusqu'alors — \"until then, up to then\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Jusqu'alors, personne ne connaissait son secret. Until then, nobody knew his secret."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Looks back to a moment in the past; from today, say jusqu'à maintenant."
            }
          ]
        },
